.SS BTRFS_IOC_SYNC
.sp
Sync the filesystem data as would \fBsync()\fP syscall do, additionally
wake up the internal transaction thread that may trigger actions like
subvolume cleaning or queued defragmentation.
.TS
center;
|l|l|.
