.TE
.SS BTRFS_IOC_ADD_DEV
.sp
Add a given block device to the filesystem. Unlike the command \fBbtrfs device add\fP
there\(aqs are no safety checks (like existence of another filesystem on the
device), device preparataion (like TRIM or zone reset), so use it with care.
.sp
This is a filesystem\-exclusive operation and it will fail if there\(aqs another
one already running, with one exception, when there\(aqs a paused balance.
.sp
Required permissions: CAP_SYS_ADMIN
.TS
center;
|l|l|.
