.SS BTRFS_IOC_RM_DEV
.sp
Remove a device from the filesystem specified by it\(aqs path, or cancel
a running device deletion by special path \fBcancel\fP\&.
.sp
This is a filesystem\-exclusive operation and it will fail if there\(aqs another
one already running.
.sp
Required permissions: CAP_SYS_ADMIN
.TS
center;
|l|l|.
