.SS BTRFS_IOC_GET_FSLABEL
.sp
Read the label of the filesystem into a given buffer. Alternatively it
can be read from \fB/sys/fs/btrfs/FSID/label\fP though it requires to
know the FSID of the filesystem.
.TS
center;
|l|l|.
